msgid "Launch directory:\n{path}\n\n{warning}If this is a recurring project, Yes creates an empty .isyroot here and saves chat sessions in your private ISyCode state directory. .isyroot identifies the workspace; it does not grant filesystem access. Not now keeps this run temporary, and its chat history is removed when ISyCode exits."
